    {
      "id": "reconnect-gap-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 530,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 200,
      "text": "RECONNECTION GAP (BUG)\n\nCurrent behavior:\n1. App restarts\n2. Sessions restored from daemon\n3. Tabs appear (from session list)\n4. BUT no auto-reconnect!\n5. User must click each tab\n\nFix: Listen for SESSIONS_RESTORED\nand auto-trigger reconnection\nfor matching context sessions.",
      "color": "#EF4444"
    },
