    {
      "id": "buffer-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 280,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "BUFFER RESTORATION\n\nPull-based mechanism:\n1. handleReady() detects reconnection\n2. getTerminalBuffer() TIPC call\n3. Worker returns scrollback[]\n4. xterm.js writes buffer\n5. Terminal shows full history\n\nComplements existing push-based\nscrollback replay on port register.",
      "color": "#22C55E"
    }
